    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obutahurra bw'abantu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Muhunde amatu inywe Abaisirairi, kiro kya hati nimwija kwambuka ekisaaru Yorudaani, mugende mutunge amahanga agarukubakira amaani n'obusobozi, mutunge embuga enkooto kandi ezinyakuzitiriirwe ebisiika ebiraihire okuhika ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "haiguru. Ihanga ery'abantu abahango kandi abaraihire, nubo batabani ba Anaki abamurukumanya kandi abamwahuliire nibagambwaho ngu: ‘nooha asobora kuhakaniza batabani ba Anaki?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habweki, kiro kinu, mumanye ogu anyakubeebembera, arukusisana omurro, kahwerekereza nuwe MUKAMA Ruhanga wanyu; naija kubasingura abahwerekereze, inywe mutakahikireyo, habweki, nimwija kubabinga mubahwerekereze bwango, MUKAMA nkooku yabanihize.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“MUKAMA Ruhanga wanyu obu araamara kubabinga mutakahikireyo muteehaahira ngu habwokuba muli bahikiriire, MUKAMA nikyo atuleetiire kulya ensi enu, kandi kunu ekimubaleeseze, nubwo obubi bw'amahanga ago agaarukubinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutagira ngu ekirukwija kubaliisa ensi enu, nubwo obuhikiriire bwanyu rundi oburungi obw'emitima yanyu; baitu nimwija kugirya habw'obubi bw'amahanga ganu, MUKAMA Ruhanga wanyu agaarukwija kubinga, mutakahikireyo, nukwo agumye eki yarahiire baisenkuru inywe: Abburahamu, Isaaka na Yakobbo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Habweki, mumanye MUKAMA Ruhanga wanyu, ekyarukubaheera ensi enu enungi, kugirya, tibuli buhikiriire bwanyu, habwokuba muli ihanga eryereme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwijuke, muleke kwebwa nkooku mwabiihiize MUKAMA Ruhanga wanyu muli omu irungu, okuruga ha kiro eki mwarugiire omunsi Misiri, okuhika obu mwahikiire omukiikaro kinu, mutaaha nimweremera MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nobwakubaire harusozi Holebbu, mukamubiihiza, akababiihirirwa muno, yayenda n'okubahwerekereza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.24.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kurug 24:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu natembere harusozi kwihayo ebyasi by'amabaale ebikaba biroho endagaano MUKAMA ei yaragaine na inywe, nkamara ebiro makumi ana n'emisana makumi ana, ntarukulya, kandi ntarukunywa kantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA yampa ebyasi by'amabaale bibiri ebinyakuhandikirwe n'orukumo rwa Ruhanga; ebyasi by'amabaale ebi, bikaba biroho ebigambo byona MUKAMA ebi akaba abagambiire omu irungu, naayema omu murro ha kiro ekimwayesorooliizeeho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebiro makumi ana n'emisana makumi ana obu byahoire, MUKAMA Ruhanga yampa ebyasi by'amabaale bibiri ebikaba bihandiikirweho endagaano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo yangambiire ati: ‘Ruga hanu osirimuke bwango, habwokuba abantu bawe aba waihire Misiri, basiisikaire bakoora ekibi, omuhanda ogunaboolekere bagurugiremu bwango, baagize ebintu, baayekorra ekisisani.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“MUKAMA nukwo kungambira ati: ‘Abantu banu mbeetegeriize, bantu ntahurra; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "otangambaho, leka mbahwerekereze ndagalize kimu ibara lyabo litagaruka kwijukwa hansi y'iguru, baitu iwe, ndikwihamu ihanga ery'obusobozi kandi ery'amaani okukira bo.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho nubwo nakubutukire naruga harusozi, orusozi nirwaka omurro; nkwasire ebyasi bibiri eby'amabaale, eby'endagaano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu nagenzire kwetegereza, nkasanga mumazire kusobya hali MUKAMA Ruhanga wanyu, mwagize ebintu, mwayekorra enyana; omuhanda MUKAMA ogu yaboolekere, mukaba mugurugiremu ira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukwo kukwata ebyasi by'amabaale ebibiri, nabihungura n'emikono yange yombi, nabyaatira aho omumaiso ganyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma, nagaruka najuumara omumaiso ga MUKAMA, nkooku nakozire okubanza, habw'ekibi eki kyona eki mwakozire nimukora ekibiihiza MUKAMA mumukwase ekiniga, nkamara emisana makumi ana n'ebiro makumi ana, ntarukulya kantu, ntarukunywa kantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.12.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Baheb 12:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba nkatiina ekiniga kya Ruhanga n'okubiihirwa kwe, ebyamuhambiriize kucwamu kubahwerekereza. Baitu noomu kasumi ako, nabwo akampuliiriza ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi akabiihirirwa muno Arooni, na uwe nukwo kwenda kumwita; omu kasumi ako, kandi nkasabira na Arooni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma nakwata ekintu eki ekyarugirirweho ekibi, niyo enyana ei mukaba mukozire, naginaga omu murro, nagihondahonda, nagisaasangura, nagisa, okuhika obu yakaniinuukire yaba nk'ecuucu, ecuucu yayo egi nagiseesa omu kasaaru akaagerega nikaruga omu rusozi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
